WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.068 line:0%
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-And finally, New Rule.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.336 line:0%
I know, it's supposed to be
that magical time of year,

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.971 line:0%
but maybe,
what we all really need

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:08.208 line:0%
right now,
is a good dose of realism.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.843 line:0%
I see a lot of nativity scenes
when I'm out,

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:12.445
as you always do
before Christmas.

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:13.679
And I can't help thinking

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:16.248
about where that manger
really is.

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:19.452
It's in the West Bank
on Palestinian land,

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:21.687
controlled
by the Palestinian authority.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:24.690
In 1950,
the little town of Bethlehem

00:00:24.823 --> 00:00:28.762
was 86 percent Christian,
now it's overwhelmingly Muslim.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.765
And that's my point tonight,
things change.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.902
To 2.3 billion Christians,
there can be no more sacred site

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:39.139
than where their Savior was born
but they don't have it anymore.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:42.508
And yet, no Crusader Army
has geared up to take it back.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:46.445
Things change.
Countries, boundaries, empires.

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:49.381
Palestine was under
the Ottoman Empire

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:51.684
for 400 years, but today,
an ottoman is something

00:00:51.817 --> 00:00:52.986
you put under your feet.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:57.023
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(CLEARS THROAT)

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.328
The city of Byzantium

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:05.664
became the city
of Constantinople,

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:08.368
became Istanbul.
Not everybody liked it,

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.136
but you can't keep arguing
the call forever.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.307
The Irish had the entire island
to themselves,

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.075
but the British were starting
an Empire,

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.110
and well,
the Irish lost their tip.

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:21.280
-(SMACKS LIPS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:25.852
-They, uh...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, CHEERING)

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.957
They blew each other up
over it for 30 years,

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.193
but eventually everybody comes
to an accommodation,

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.229
except the Palestinians.

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.397
Was it unjust

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:41.234
that even a single Arab family
was forced to move

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.002
upon the founding
of the Jewish state? Yes.

00:01:44.269 --> 00:01:45.638
But it's also not rare.

00:01:45.971 --> 00:01:48.574
Happening all through history,
all over the world,

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.310
and mostly what people do
is make the best of it.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:54.280
After World War II,
12 million ethnic Germans

00:01:54.413 --> 00:01:57.383
got shoved out of Russia,
and Poland, and Czechoslovakia

00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:00.286
because being German had become
kind of unpopular.

00:02:00.419 --> 00:02:02.321
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:02.454 --> 00:02:05.691
A million Greeks were shoved
out of Turkey in 1923,

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:08.628
a million Ghanaians
out of Nigeria in 1983,

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:12.165
almost a million French
out of Algeria in 1962,

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:15.301
nearly a million Syrian refugees
moved to Germany

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:18.037
eight years ago.
Was that a perfect fit?

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:21.474
And no one knows more
about being pushed off land...

00:02:21.607 --> 00:02:22.608
(SCOFFS) ...than the Jews.

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.144
Including being
almost wholly kicked out

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:28.414
of every Arab country
they once lived in.

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:34.320
-Yes, TikTok fans. Ethnic--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.722
Ethnic cleansing happened
both ways.

00:02:37.289 --> 00:02:40.092
In<i> Fiddler on the Roof,</i>
the family is always moving

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.161
to stay one step ahead
of the Cossacks,

00:02:42.294 --> 00:02:43.496
but they deal with it.

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:45.531
When they're leaving Anatevka,
they say,

00:02:45.664 --> 00:02:47.933
"Hey, it wasn't so great
anyway."

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:52.472
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:53.372 --> 00:02:54.908
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:00.112
"Come on. Like other countries
don't have roofs

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:02.749
-you could fiddle on."
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:05.584
-(CHUCKLES)
-BILL MAHER: Now...

00:03:06.051 --> 00:03:08.288
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:03:09.621 --> 00:03:11.224
Now, that's not
how they really felt,

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:13.859
but they were coping.
They coped.

00:03:14.426 --> 00:03:16.495
Because sometimes,
that's all you can do.

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:19.965
History is brutal
and humans are not good people.

00:03:20.165 --> 00:03:22.067
History is sad
and full of wrongs,

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:23.869
but you can't make them unhappen

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:26.673
because a paraglider
isn't a time machine.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.075
People get moved,
and yes, colonized.

00:03:30.242 --> 00:03:33.445
Nobody was a bigger colonizer
than the Muslim army

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:35.214
that swept out
of the Arabian Desert

00:03:35.347 --> 00:03:37.983
and took over much of the world
in a single century.

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:39.719
And they didn't do it
by asking.

00:03:40.319 --> 00:03:43.055
There's a reason
Saudi Arabia's flag is a sword.

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:46.759
Kosovo was the cradle
of Christian Serbia,

00:03:46.892 --> 00:03:48.094
then it became Muslim.

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:51.797
They fought a war about it
in the '90s, but stopped.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.801
They didn't keep it going
for 75 years.

00:03:55.467 --> 00:03:56.602
There were deals on the table

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:58.805
to share the land
called Palestine.

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:04.410
In 1947, '93, '95, '98,

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.745
2000, 2008.

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:08.815
And East Jerusalem
could have been the capital

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:11.918
of a Palestinian state
that today might look

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:14.453
more like Dubai than Gaza.

00:04:15.321 --> 00:04:18.090
Arafat was offered 95 percent
of the West Bank,

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:19.925
and said no.

00:04:20.826 --> 00:04:23.128
The Palestinian people
should know, your leaders

00:04:23.262 --> 00:04:25.664
and the useful idiots
on college campuses

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:29.034
who are their allies
are not doing you any favors

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:32.171
by keeping alive
"The River to the Sea" myth.

00:04:32.571 --> 00:04:34.774
I mean where do you think
Israel is going?

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:39.712
-Spoiler alert, nowhere.
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:48.688
It's one of the most
powerful countries in the world

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:51.024
with the 500-billion-dollar
economy,

00:04:51.157 --> 00:04:53.226
the world's second largest
tech sector

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:56.195
after Silicon Valley,
and nuclear weapons.

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:58.131
They're here,
they like their bagel

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:01.968
-with a shmear, get used to it.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:10.977
What's happening to Palestinians
today is horrible,

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.812
and not just in Gaza,
in the West Bank too.

00:05:14.146 --> 00:05:16.181
But wars end with negotiation

00:05:16.315 --> 00:05:18.184
and what the media glosses
over is--

00:05:18.417 --> 00:05:19.585
It's hard to negotiate

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:21.687
when the other side's
bargaining position

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:23.990
is you all die and disappear.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.393
(SCOFFS) I mean, the chant
"From the River to the Sea."

00:05:27.693 --> 00:05:28.995
Yeah, let's look at the map.

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:31.831
Here's the river,
here's the sea.

00:05:32.331 --> 00:05:34.133
Oh, I see,
it means you get all of it.

00:05:34.733 --> 00:05:35.868
Not just the West Bank

00:05:36.001 --> 00:05:39.438
which was basically the original
UN partition deal you rejected

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:42.041
because you wanted all of it
and always have.

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:43.976
Even though, it's indisputably

00:05:44.109 --> 00:05:46.478
also the Jews'
ancestral homeland.

00:05:46.812 --> 00:05:52.685
And so, you attacked and lost.
And attacked again and lost.

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.987
And attacked again and lost.

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:58.423
As my friend, Dr. Phil says,
"How's that working for you?"

00:05:58.557 --> 00:06:02.662
(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:06:07.432 --> 00:06:09.835
Look at what Mexico used to own.

00:06:10.068 --> 00:06:12.438
All the way up
to the top of California,

00:06:12.571 --> 00:06:14.406
but no Mexican is out there
chanting,

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.541
"From the Rio Grande
to Portland, Oregon."

00:06:16.675 --> 00:06:20.747
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:06:26.451 --> 00:06:28.387
Because they chose
a different path.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.722
They got real
and built a country

00:06:30.856 --> 00:06:33.759
that's the world's 14th biggest
economy now.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.894
Because they knew
the United States

00:06:36.028 --> 00:06:38.297
wasn't going to give back
Phoenix,

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:41.366
any more than Hamas will ever be
in Tel Aviv.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.269
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-One of...

00:06:43.335 --> 00:06:46.305
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:06:48.341 --> 00:06:50.443
One of the leaders
of Hamas says...

00:06:59.885 --> 00:07:00.986
(SCOFFS)
I'm sorry, who's the one

00:07:01.119 --> 00:07:02.755
with imaginary dreams?

00:07:03.522 --> 00:07:06.291
If I give you the benefit
of the doubt and say your plan

00:07:06.425 --> 00:07:08.427
for a completely Jew-less
Palestine

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:10.529
isn't that all the Jews
should die.

00:07:10.963 --> 00:07:13.332
(SMACKS LIPS)
What is the only other option?

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.802
They move.
You move all the Jews.

00:07:17.469 --> 00:07:18.737
(SCOFFS)
Okay, I got to warn you,

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:20.373
there's gonna be some kvetching.

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:23.609
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:07:23.909 --> 00:07:24.911
(SCOFFS)

00:07:28.981 --> 00:07:31.416
You move all the Jews
and we do this with what?

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.852
A fleet of trucks
called Jew-haul.

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:39.325
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:07:41.427 --> 00:07:45.430
And to where are we moving
this entire country? Texas?

00:07:45.564 --> 00:07:48.967
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-Sure, they have room

00:07:49.101 --> 00:07:51.736
and I guess we could put
the Wailing Wall on the border

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.673
and kill two birds
with one stone.

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:56.976
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-Or we could just get serious.

